*======================================================================*
* GPSS DATA PROCESSING UTILITY - VALIDATOR LOGIC                  *
*======================================================================*

BLOCKSIZE 80

title  DATA_VALIDATOR_MODULE

*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
* 1. VALIDATION STAGE                                              *
*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
* Transactions arrive at validator                                 *
   GENERATE    -1,,100       * 100 raw records

* Check-in to Validator Facility                               *
   ENTER       VALIDATOR_F

* Validation Logic (Simulated)                                   *
* Check if Attribute 1 is within range (e.g., > 0)               *
   IFN         1, 0, VALID_PASS

   * If invalid, send to reject queue                             *
   TRANS       VALID_FAIL

VALID_PASS
   * Check-out and proceed                                        *
   LEAVE       VALIDATOR_F
   TERMINATE     0

VALID_FAIL
   * Simulate Logging Failure                                     *
   BLOCK       5
   LEAVE       VALIDATOR_F
   TERMINATE     0

*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
* 2. FACILITIES & QUEUES                                         *
*--------------------------------------------------------------------*
   FACILITY    VALIDATOR_F

   START       1

END
